    "content": "---\npaths:\n  - \"**/*.py\"\n  - \"**/*.pyi\"\n---\n# Python Security\n\n> Language-specific security checks for Python\n\n## Secret Management\n\n```python\nimport os\nfrom dotenv import load_dotenv\n\nload_dotenv()\n\napi_key = os.environ[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]  # Raises KeyError if missing\n```\n\n## Security Scanning\n\n- Use **bandit** for static security analysis:\n  ```bash\n  bandit -r src/\n  ```\n",
